{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324650/extras/15bdac6d52679f5822e1b5d8cc23cff3.avif?t=1758545737\" width=800 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Judenki Kashite&quot; is a game inspired by masterpieces of games, films, manga, and anime from the 1980s to the 2020s, created with deep respect and admiration for the great creators behind them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience hyper-speed noir action that pushes the limits of intensity, while enjoying a quietly unfolding story delicately woven within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move with WASD keys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can talk with the E key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't pay respects by pressing F key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can shoot with the left mouse button, but unfortunately, there are no moon-dust, so portals won't open.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a single player game. So you don't have to stress about playing with 9 cheaters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no 'weapon skin' feature. So you don't have to spend $1000 to get a weapon skin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Judenki Kashite&quot; is currently in development. It will be completed at least before Half-Life 3 is released.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This description is written to the best of my ability, following the guideline of &quot;You can't release a game without sufficient description of its features and content.&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ETC</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're planning to create an introduction or gameplay video for &quot;Judenki Kashite,&quot; pleas